          {
            "raw_output": "\"Loaded config for job: solar_flare_forecasting\\n\"\n\"Loaded scalers for 13 channels.\"\n\"The index /home/jovyan/surya_workshop/data/indices/surya_aws_s3_train.csv contains s3:// paths (e.g. s3://nasa-surya-bench/2010/05/20100513_0012.nc) but s3_cache_dir is not set (s3_mode='download').\\n\\nSet it in the data: section of your config YAML:\\n\\n    data:\\n      s3_cache_dir: /home/jovyan/.cache/surya_workshop/helio_s3_cache\\n\\n...or, to keep the config machine-independent, set it outside the config:\\n\\n    export SURYA_WS_CACHE_DIR=/home/jovyan/.cache/surya_workshop/helio_s3_cache\\n    # or pass --s3-cache-dir <path> to the training script\\n\\nEach full-resolution SDO NetCDF file is ~1 GB, so pick a filesystem with roughly 1 GB x (number of unique timesteps) free.\\nAlternatively set s3_mode: stream to read without a local cache (not recommended for NetCDF/HDF5 \u2014 it requires random seeks).\"\n\"Cell \\u001b[0;32mIn[7], line 1\\u001b[0m\\n\\u001b[0;32m----> 1\\u001b[0m train_dataset \\u001b[38;5;241m=\\u001b[39m \\u001b[43mFlareDSDataset\\u001b[49m\\u001b[43m(\\u001b[49m\\n\\u001b[1;32m      2\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;66;43;03m#### All these lines are required by the parent HelioNetCDFDataset class\\u001b[39;49;00m\\n\\u001b[1;32m      3\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[43mindex_path\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m=\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mcfg\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mdata\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mtrain_data_path\\u001b[49m\\u001b[43m,\\u001b[49m\\n\\u001b[1;32m      4\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[43mtime_delta_input_minutes\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m=\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mcfg\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mdata\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mtime_delta_input_minutes\\u001b[49m\\u001b[43m,\\u001b[49m\\n\\u001b[1;32m      5\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[43mtime_delta_target_minutes\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m=\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mcfg\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mdata\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mtime_delta_target_minutes\\u001b[49m\\u001b[43m,\\u001b[49m\\n\\u001b[1;32m      6\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[43mn_input_timestamps\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m=\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mcfg\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mmodel\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mtime_embedding\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mtime_dim\\u001b[49m\\u001b[43m,\\u001b[49m\\n\\u001b[1;32m      7\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[43mrollout_steps\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m=\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mcfg\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mrollout_steps\\u001b[49m\\u001b[43m,\\u001b[49m\\n\\u001b[1;32m      8\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[43mchannels\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m=\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mcfg\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mdata\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mchannels\\u001b[49m\\u001b[43m,\\u001b[49m\\n\\u001b[1;32m      9\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[43mdrop_hmi_probability\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m=\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mcfg\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mdrop_hmi_probability\\u001b[49m\\u001b[43m,\\u001b[49m\\n\\u001b[1;32m     10\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[43muse_latitude_in_learned_flow\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m=\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mcfg\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m.\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43muse_latitude_in_learned_flow\\u001b[49m\\u001b[43m,\\u001b[49m\\n\\u001b[1;32m     11\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[43mscalers\\u001b[49m\\u001b[38;5;241;43m=\\u001b[39;49m\\u001b[43mscalers\\u001b[49m\\u001b[43m,\\u001b[49m\\n\\u001b[1;32m     12\\u001b[0m \\u001b[43m    \\u001b[49m\\u001b[43mphase\\u001b